The first-prime emission has passed the parked and compatibility regressions through the loaded rungs and is now serializing the large graph block. The only initial failure was in the negative-control harness choosing a term removed by the mandated `uf30=0` pin; I tightened the control to perturb a retained term, and the mathematical rows were unchanged.
